{"product_id":"pod-salt-strawberry-marshmallow","title":"POD SALT - Strawberry Marshmallow","description":"\u003cp\u003eA smooth and creamy blend of POD SALT Marshmallow and strawberries for an indulgent and fruity vape. Finished with a touch of sweet vanilla. If you like your dessert vapes, you’re going to love this combination of strawberry and marshmallow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 25mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod nic salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41806980218935,"sku":"POD S - Strawberry Marshmallow - 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41806980251703,"sku":"POD S - Strawberry Marshmallow - 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-marshmallow-strawberry-marshmallow-salts-30ml.webp?v=1754245514","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-strawberry-marshmallow","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




